    "text": "A loop <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>PQR</mi></math> carries a current&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> as shown in the figure. A uniform magnetic field <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2&#160;</mn><mn>T</mn></math>&nbsp;exists in space parallel to the plane of the loop. The magnetic torque on the loop is<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0063_fc8d4bd068b0.jpg\" style=\"width: 178px; height: 164px;\" />"
