  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#160;T</mi></math><br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0063_fc8d4bd068b0.jpg\" style=\"width: 178px; height: 164px;\" /><br />Area of the loop is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#964;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi></math> [Here, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>90</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math>]<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#964;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>90</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p>"
